{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id157220477"}, "name":{"label":"Viicetm"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-10-04T10:41:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.2"}, "id":{"label":"1461007709"}, "title":{"label":"I never write reviews, but..."}, "content":{"label":"This app seriously has changed my life. That might sound dramatic for a simple noise-maker app, but it's true. I'm a CIT student and I have to study pretty much every free second of every day, and I live in a loud environment that doesn't always lend itself well to that. This app is amazing for creating a soothing environment when you're trying to drown out the noise. I used to listen to instrumental music when I studied because lyrics can be distracting, but if you truly want to zone out to what you're doing Noisli is so much better for that. I find myself totally in my own world to this app and coming back to myself after a nice long study session and realizing Noisli is still going, pretty much forgetting about it because it was working so well, is really what it's designed for. As odd as it sounds, you won't even realize it's doing it's job. Just recently, too, I started sleeping with the fan/wind combo going instead of keeping my ceiling fan on all night (because it's getting cold) and it works very well for that too. Totally keeps the dogs from waking me up across the house. I can't recommend this app enough, you HAVE to try it to understand.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"3"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id474324161"}, "name":{"label":"Daynaj43"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-10-01T20:14:56-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.2"}, "id":{"label":"1459405777"}, "title":{"label":"Disappointed for sure"}, "content":{"label":"I wanted to buy an app to help me sleep when I'm traveling because I'm a super light sleeper and I sleep with a box fan at home to help me sleep better. Got this app because it had the fan option, however the fan is beyond quiet and would never be able to block out noises for me to sleep well... Glad the thunderstorm is loud, though! Still very disappointed about the fan...", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id26832504"}, "name":{"label":"murray.jacob"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-09-15T16:19:35-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.2"}, "id":{"label":"1450338595"}, "title":{"label":"Still no random option?"}, "content":{"label":"You folks are amazing, so I must be missing something. Please add the Random button to the mobile app. I use it constantly on desktop and I wish I could get it with the paid app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id167338579"}, "name":{"label":"SuzNik-"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-09-10T13:25:22-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.2"}, "id":{"label":"1447657822"}, "title":{"label":"Very useful"}, "content":{"label":"I've used Noisil in a cubicle area, for meditation, and to block out/neutralize other sound. For noise blocking the brown noise is very effective (volume adjusted to blend) when layered in with other sounds. The rain, water droplet and thunderstorm are great when combined too. Thanks so much for this app! It's a tool I'm glad I can count on.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
