{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id14127569"}, "name":{"label":"wackyiraqi"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-06-08T09:07:56-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"1391049222"}, "title":{"label":"Well designed, with one big flaw"}, "content":{"label":"A fantastic, cleanly designed app in every way but one huge one: it needs to pause/stop the noise when the headphone jack is unplugged. Compared to most iPhone audio that stops automatically when you (purposely or accidentally) unplug, Noisli keeps playing loudly until you go through the clumsy steps of unlocking your phone, opening the app, and stopping the sound manually. At best it's inconvenient, at worst it can be very embarassing to unplug and blast a quiet room or train car with loud noise from your phone.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id30768133"}, "name":{"label":"nursenancy23"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-05-14T14:45:38-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"1378683893"}, "title":{"label":"Misophonia Must-Have!"}, "content":{"label":"As someone with misophonia, I use this app every night to drown out miscellaneous sounds from my apartment complex. I like the fan sound, and the rain.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id146042858"}, "name":{"label":"JonJCR"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-05-04T21:30:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"1373681038"}, "title":{"label":"Almost as good as the web version"}, "content":{"label":"I really like the app for productivity. However, the app is lacking in a key feature that I love on the web version which is the preset sounds for relaxation, productivity or random. Please bring these features over to the app and it will be perfect.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id102673278"}, "name":{"label":"Desertdance85"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-04-25T18:14:13-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"1368852998"}, "title":{"label":"Engine sound crept in?"}, "content":{"label":"I was listening to the creek sound and I hear engine noises in the back. \nYou would think they could put a creek sounds that does not have cars passing by in the background. \n\nInterface is great. \nBut being a noise app, the noises should be clean and free from background noises of cars passing by. Please change the creek sound.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id276920707"}, "name":{"label":"TechiePri"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-04-17T15:23:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"1365021679"}, "title":{"label":"Almost Perfect"}, "content":{"label":"I really enjoy this app with the different volume settings for each kind of sound. I do wish it had the addition like the online version for premade productive, relax, or random sound combinations. I like just clicking them and the combinations being given and if I want a new one I just click it again.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id81036215"}, "name":{"label":"Sarah2124096"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-04-09T23:50:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"1361264412"}, "title":{"label":"i love it"}, "content":{"label":"i made an account so i could use my combos everywhere, because i love it so much. as soon as i logged in on the app, it crashed. i have been unable to use it for days. praying that deleting it and reinstalling will do the trick. it's such a great app, aside from this one bug which ruins the experience for the people who like it most.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id237201723"}, "name":{"label":"xRIPx Vicks"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-03-15T21:52:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"1348537586"}, "title":{"label":"Great sounds."}, "content":{"label":"I really like your app. I think the white noise volume doesn't adjust low enough I believe that it's a bit too loud even at low volume. That is why I prefer the fan noise. \n\nA great noise that should be added should be a ticking clock to build up pressure to stay focused and get whatever it is done.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id193942845"}, "name":{"label":"Tosey445"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-03-10T04:56:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"1345685290"}, "title":{"label":"Awesome sounds--glitchy app"}, "content":{"label":"I love the ability to create my own combinations of sounds. The app is very pretty and simple--which I like--but it constantly is glitching out. 1. Sometimes the drag bars below each sound don't move or a second one appears and 2. sometimes when I create a combo it freezes and you can't create another one unless you restart the app. If the developers fix these bugs I would give 5 stars hands down!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id272285696"}, "name":{"label":"Erik8137"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-03-06T10:49:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"1343874693"}, "title":{"label":"Great noise generator, glitchy app."}, "content":{"label":"I love the sound that the app produces and the ability to easily mix sounds. Unlike some other generators I’ve tried, it doesn’t obviously loop within a few seconds.\n\nThe UI would be clean and good if it worked well. -2 stars for all the UI glitches. Volume sliders frequently don’t disappear when toggling sounds off. Sometimes multiple sliders are rendered under a sound that isn’t playing. Multiple lines of text are rendered on top of one another when adding a preset. It’s not a complete deal breaker but feels very sloppy. I often find myself killing it and restarting it to get it into the state I want.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id87034649"}, "name":{"label":"Jenguerty"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-02-12T20:09:45-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"1332117773"}, "title":{"label":"Works great! Even has a timer."}, "content":{"label":"Love it and love the timer. Lots of sound options.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id24856773"}, "name":{"label":"DivineKyuubi"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-02-03T20:41:04-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"1327465496"}, "title":{"label":"Great app, could use a few more sounds"}, "content":{"label":"Great for taking naps. I have no complaints about this app, but more sounds would be great. Also, please add train whistles to the train tracks sound or add a train whistle we could play over it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id33493927"}, "name":{"label":"penbot"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-01-10T11:56:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"1314480181"}, "title":{"label":"Baby Tested and Approved"}, "content":{"label":"I downloaded this app before for some ambient noise of myself to relax.  Last week, my little nephew who is only three months came over and was getting fussy.  I turned on the computer and used the online app.  My sis-in-law was amazed because it knocked out my nephew within minutes.  She downloaded it herself and says it works like a charm when my nephew needs to take a nap and it’s better than the white noise machine they bought to calm him.  I also say it’s a better buy because you can take it with you when you go to a place where you can’t take a white noise machine.  So, thanks for making such a great app that gives my nephew sweet dreams.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id233339466"}, "name":{"label":"Taskmaster775"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-01-06T08:42:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"1312237810"}, "title":{"label":"Great for productivity"}, "content":{"label":"Started using this in my home office to give me a little bit of ambient noise. I have found it much easier to concentrate and quite enjoy the ability to change up the noise, add in different sounds etc. Super easy app to use.\n\nOne improvement would be the ability to pause the sounds through the native iOS sound controls. For example you cannot pause the sounds by sliding up from the bottom of your home screen. IOS does not recognize that the app is actually playing sounds. So you cannot pause from here.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id6490834"}, "name":{"label":"Lentziewentzie"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2015-12-13T07:29:58-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"1300075755"}, "title":{"label":"Just the thing"}, "content":{"label":"Pros: \n• sounds are not repetitive \n• nice sound choices \n• sleep timer\n• ability to save combos\n• sounds are appropriate for various moods and/or times of day \nCons: \n• none in my opinion", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
